# Gauntlet runs on the trip plaque: the trip starts in the lobby, a run starts when the game marks
# the player as in the Gauntlet, its preparation ends when the game marks the Hunllef's fight as
# started, and it ends on the completion count line. The pet's message joins the run, a seed taken
# from the reward chest afterwards joins it too, and a run left in the preparation is logged as left.
# Nothing on the plaque moves during the Hunllef fight, and nothing speaks about the fight.
# Schematic, not the real map. Facts: the varbits are RuneLite gameval VarbitID.PLAYER_IN_GAUNTLET
# (9178) and GAUNTLET_BOSS_STARTED (9177) (that they mark a run and the fight is read from their
# names, unconfirmed); the lobby is region 12127 and the corrupted and regular mazes are regions 7768
# and 7512 (RuneLite's Discord plugin, MG_GAUNTLET and MG_CORRUPTED_GAUNTLET); "Your Corrupted
# Gauntlet completion count is:" and "Corrupted challenge duration:" are RuneLite's chat commands
# lines; "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed." is Youngllef's (oldschool.runescape.wiki,
# Youngllef). The corrupted preparation limit is 7:30 (The Gauntlet).
scene 3000 6070
skill ATTACK 85
skill STRENGTH 85
skill DEFENCE 80
skill RANGED 85
skill MAGIC 80
skill HITPOINTS 85
skill PRAYER 77
item SHARK "Shark"
item PRIF_ARMOUR_SEED "Crystal armour seed"
items INV SHARK 2
at 3030 6100
login
watch over tripPlaque.shown.over
watch title tripPlaque.shown.title
watch line0 tripPlaque.shown.lines.0.text
watch line1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.text
watch right1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.right
watch line2 tripPlaque.shown.lines.2.text
watch right2 tripPlaque.shown.lines.2.right
never line1 ~ "pray"
never line1 ~ "attack"
never line1 ~ "tornado"
never line2 ~ "Supplies"
tick 2
expect over = "BOSS PILOT: ON A TRIP"
expect title = "The Gauntlet"
expect line0 ~ "0 runs done in"

# Into the corrupted maze: the preparation clock runs against the 7:30 limit.
scene 1900 5600
varbit PLAYER_IN_GAUNTLET 1
at 1950 5660
tick 2
expect title = "The Corrupted Gauntlet"
expect line1 ~ "Preparing 0:0"
expect line1 ~ "/ 7:30"
tick 100
expect line1 ~ "Preparing 1:0"

# The Hunllef's fight begins, through a loading screen: the line holds still from here to the end
# of the fight, and the preparation's clock is not reset by the load.
state LOADING
state LOGGED_IN
varbit GAUNTLET_BOSS_STARTED 1
tick 2
expect line1 ~ "Hunllef fight, prep 1:0"
always line1 ~ "Hunllef fight, prep 1:0"
tick 150
expect line1 ~ "Hunllef fight, prep 1:0"
forget
never line1 ~ "pray"
never line1 ~ "attack"

# The game's lines: the run time, then the count, then the pet a tick later.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Corrupted challenge duration: <col=ff0000>2:40.20</col>. Personal best: 2:30.00."
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Corrupted Gauntlet completion count is: <col=ff0000>7</col>."
tick
chat GAMEMESSAGE "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed."
tick 4
expect line0 ~ "1 run done in"
expect saved.gauntletV1 ~ Youngllef
expect saved.gauntletV1 ~ :7,            # the completion count, saved: "kc":7
expect saved.gauntletV1 ~ CORRUPTED
expect line1 = "Last: KC 7 in 2:40"

# Out to the lobby, and an armour seed from the reward chest joins that run.
varbit GAUNTLET_BOSS_STARTED 0
varbit PLAYER_IN_GAUNTLET 0
scene 3000 6070
at 3030 6100
tick 2
items INV PRIF_ARMOUR_SEED 1
tick 2
expect saved.gauntletV1 ~ "Crystal armour seed"
expect title = "The Gauntlet"

# A regular run left in the preparation: logged as left, with no reward roll.
scene 1820 5600
varbit PLAYER_IN_GAUNTLET 1
at 1880 5660
tick 20
expect line1 ~ "Preparing 0:1"
expect line1 ~ "/ 10:00"
varbit PLAYER_IN_GAUNTLET 0
scene 3000 6070
at 3030 6100
tick 2
expect saved.gauntletV1 ~ LEFT
expect line1 = "Last: left in the prep"

# Logging out ends the trip; the log stays.
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
expect title = null
